<th style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 10px; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 20px; font-family: Microsoft JhengHei, Tahoma, Arial, Helvetica, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400;">
<h1 style="margin: 0px 0px 17.39px;padding-top: 25px;text-align: left;color: #fefefe;line-height: 1.3;font-family: Microsoft JhengHei, Tahoma, Arial, Helvetica, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;font-weight: 400;border-collapse: collapse !important;-ms-word-break: keep-all;-ms-word-wrap: normal;-ms-hyphens: none;-moz-hyphens: none;-webkit-hyphens: none;hyphens: none;">
恭喜您，您的會員申請已獲得核准及處理！</h1>
</th>
<th class="callout-inner" style="padding:15px;"><img src="https://intel--crmdevint3.sandbox.file.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0152i0000000fuQ&oid=00D2i0000008d6j&lastMod=1691395447000" alt="Intel" title="Intel" align="right" class="float-center" style="height:100%;width:auto"></th>
<th class="expander" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px !important; width: 0px; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 20px; font-family: Microsoft JhengHei, Tahoma, Arial, Helvetica, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400; visibility: hidden;"></th>
