<table class="row module full-width" style="padding: 0px; width: 100%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; display: table; border-collapse: collapse; position: relative; border-spacing: 0; background-color: #fefefe;">
<tbody>
<tr style="padding: 0px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;">
<th class="small-12 large-12 columns first last" style="margin: 0px auto; padding: 20px 20px 10px; width: 650px; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 20px; font-family: Microsoft JhengHei, Tahoma, Arial, Helvetica, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400; vertical-align: top; background-color: #fefefe;">
<table style="padding: 0px; width: 100%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0;">
<tbody>
<tr style="padding: 0px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;">
<th style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 20px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400;"> 
<p class="h2" style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; color: #0071c5; line-height: 19px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 400; border-collapse: collapse !important; -ms-word-break: keep-all; -ms-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; -webkit-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;"><span class="eloquaemail"></span></p> 
<p style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 20px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400; border-collapse: collapse !important; -ms-word-break: keep-all; -ms-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; -webkit-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">
歡迎來到 Intel&reg; 夥伴聯盟計畫！ 
<br> 
<br> 
很高興您能加入這個整合生態系統，讓夥伴與 Intel 生態系統連結，加速創新解決方案，實現業務成果並開啟成長契機
<br> <br> 
為確保您能夠持續存取您的帳戶，請在收到本電子郵件後 <b>45 天</b>內登入。登入可讓您的個人檔案保持活躍，並與貴公司綁定。 </p>
<p style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 20px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400; border-collapse: collapse !important; -ms-word-break: keep-all; -ms-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; -webkit-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">
透過為貴企業量身打造的福利，您將能： 
<ul style="color: #555554; line-height: 20px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400; border-collapse: collapse !important; -ms-word-break: keep-all; -ms-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; -webkit-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">
<li>利用最新的工具、訓練與資源，開創全新的商機</li>
<li>透過合格的購買項目與活動，賺取並兌換點數</li>
<li>利用市場開發基金加速行銷與銷售成功</li>
<li>在最新的 Intel&reg; 軟體上學習、設計原型及測試工作負載</li>
<li>透過 Intel&reg; 夥伴大學的一流訓練，拓展知識</li>
<li>利用 NDA 內容、藍圖和開發者工具打造創新產品</li>
<li>利用 Intel&reg; 行銷工作室的共同行銷素材，快速推出行銷活動</li>
<li>透過 Intel&reg; Partner Showcase 的夥伴店面，開創合格的潛在客戶</li>
</ul>
<p style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 20px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400; border-collapse: collapse !important; -ms-word-break: keep-all; -ms-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; -webkit-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">
<a href="	https://crmdevint3-intelcloudcrm.cs279.force.com/ipa/s/post-launch-primary"> 登入開始使用 </a>
<br>
<br>
如果需要 Intel 登入程序的協助，請按一下<a href="https://urldefense.com/v3/__https:/www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/support/articles/000092340/programs/access-entitlement-for-myintel-users.html?wapkw=mfa__;!!OrxsNty6D4my!4buZDlfdnsvirTD6XYVVBD1pnJ7qKMcJaVV6YzAZElmyQgjpWFG52NW6D3SLA49tvFBtnXgcv5RXUpcFtGHoaFbzfZ4aNs1K_A$">這裡。 </a>










<p style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 20px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400; border-collapse: collapse !important; -ms-word-break: keep-all; -ms-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; -webkit-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">
<p style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 11px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400; border-collapse: collapse !important; -ms-word-break: keep-all; -ms-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; -webkit-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;"> 
<tr><td style="word-break:break-all;font-size: 11px;color: #555554;font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400;"> 
<br>
謝謝您，<br> 
您的 Intel&reg;&nbsp;夥伴聯盟團隊</p></td></tr> 
</th>
<th class="expander" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px !important; width: 0px; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 20px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400; visibility: hidden;"></th> 
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</th>
</tr>
