<tr>
<td class="auto-style1" valign="top" style="font-size: 10px; color: #ffffff; font-family: Microsoft JhengHei, Tahoma, Arial, Helvetica, Verdana, sans-serif; line-height: 14px; padding-top: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; text-align: center;">
此訊息作為您目前與Intel&reg;&nbsp;夥伴聯盟關係相關的重要商業通訊發送給您。</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="auto-style1" valign="top" style="font-size: 10px;color: #ffffff; font-family: Microsoft JhengHei, Tahoma, Arial, Helvetica, Verdana, sans-serif; line-height: 14px; padding-bottom: 10px; text-align: center;">&copy;
{!$Label.PRM_CurrentYear}Intel公司</td>
</tr>
